§§ `Article 57(5) and (7), Article 58, Article 62(5) — validity (src 1073-1091, 1117-1129, 1255-1261)`

-- Generated by gen_tables.py from src 1074-1077; one assertion per class named there.
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class A1` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class A` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class B1` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class B` EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class C1` EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class C` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class D1` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class D2` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class D` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class BE` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class C1E` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class CE` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class D1E` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class D2E` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Article 57(5) — the term in years of a licence of` `class DE` EQUALS JUST 5

-- A class B licence issued on 15 March 2025 runs 10 years from issue (src 1075); the anniversary is its last day (fork F3).
#ASSERT `the last day of validity of the licence` (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15)) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2035 3 15)
#ASSERT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15)) `is in force on` (YMD 2035 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15)) `is in force on` (YMD 2035 3 16)
-- Class C: 5 years (src 1076-1077).
#ASSERT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a licence of` `class C` `issued on` (YMD 2025 1 10)) `is in force on` (YMD 2030 1 10)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a licence of` `class C` `issued on` (YMD 2025 1 10)) `is in force on` (YMD 2030 1 11)
-- Class A1: no term (src 1074).
#ASSERT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a licence of` `class A1` `issued on` (YMD 2025 1 10)) `is in force on` (YMD 2090 1 1)
-- Not in force before it is issued.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15)) `is in force on` (YMD 2025 3 14)
-- A printed expiry that is not the Article 57(5) term is a contradictory record.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the last day of validity of the licence` (`a Vietnamese licence of` (`a class under Article 57` `class B`) `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15) `, printed expiry` (JUST (YMD 2030 3 15)) `, restriction` `no restriction` `, points` 12 `, revoked on` NOTHING `, withdrawn` NOTHING) BECAUSE "the expiry date printed on the licence is not the one Article 57(5) gives its class"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the last day of validity of the licence` (`a Vietnamese licence of` (`a class under Article 57` `class A1`) `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15) `, printed expiry` (JUST (YMD 2035 3 15)) `, restriction` `no restriction` `, points` 12 `, revoked on` NOTHING `, withdrawn` NOTHING) BECAUSE "the expiry date printed on the licence is not the one Article 57(5) gives its class"
-- 57(7)(b) with 62(5): revoked on 1 May 2026, not in force from that day (src 1091, 1255).
#ASSERT `Article 57(7) — the licence` (`a Vietnamese licence of` (`a class under Article 57` `class B`) `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 15) `, printed expiry` NOTHING `, restriction` `no restriction` `, points` 12 `, revoked on` (JUST (YMD 2026 5 1)) `, withdrawn` NOTHING) `is in force on` (YMD 2026 4 30)
