#ASSERT `Article 2(2) — the group of` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 50 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90) EQUALS `motor vehicles`
#ASSERT `Article 2(2) — the group of` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) EQUALS `special-use machines`
#ASSERT `Article 2(2) — the group of` (`a bicycle moved by` `human power, through pedals or a hand crank`) EQUALS `rudimentary vehicles`
