-- 2(9): the person driving a motor vehicle is "người lái xe"; the others are named apart; 2(8)'s carried persons and pedestrians drive nothing.
#ASSERT `Article 2(9) — the role of` (`a person driving` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING)) EQUALS `the driver of a motor vehicle`
