#ASSERT `Article 2(9) — the role of` (`a person driving` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000)) EQUALS `the operator of a special-use machine`
#ASSERT `Article 2(9) — the role of` (`a person driving` (`a bicycle moved by` `human power, through pedals or a hand crank`)) EQUALS `the driver of a rudimentary vehicle`
#ASSERT `Article 2(9) — the role of` (`a person carried` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 125 `cm3, designed for` 100 `km/h, kerb mass` 120)) EQUALS `not a person driving`
#ASSERT `Article 2(9) — the role of` `a pedestrian on the road` EQUALS `not a person driving`
-- 9(7): handing a motor vehicle or special-use machine to a person who does not meet the conditions to drive it.
#ASSERT `Article 9(7) — handing` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `to` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2009 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY) `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(7) — handing` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `to` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1996 4 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 2 1)))) `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `Article 9(7) — handing` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 50 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90) `to` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2011 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY) `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(7) — handing` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 50 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90) `to` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2009 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY) `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT `Article 9(7) — handing` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) `to` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2000 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY) `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A bicycle is neither a motor vehicle nor a special-use machine: 9(7) does not reach it.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 9(7) — handing` (`a bicycle moved by` `human power, through pedals or a hand crank`) `to` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2016 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY) `is prohibited for want of age or licence, on` (YMD 2026 6 1)

§§ `Article 88 and Decision 1 (src 969-972, 1003-1005, 1950-1957)`

-- Article 88(1): this Law governs from 1 January 2025.
#ASSERT `Article 88 — this Law governs` (YMD 2025 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` (YMD 2024 12 31)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1990 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `former class B2, for a professional driver` `issued on` (YMD 2015 1 1) `, expiring` (JUST (YMD 2025 1 1))))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2024 12 31) BECAUSE "the Road Traffic Law 23/2008/QH12 governs a day before 1 January 2025, and it is not in the sources"
-- A 30-year-old with a class B licence of 2025, driving a 5-seat car in 2026: may drive.
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1996 4 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 2 1)))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- The same driver in a 20-seat bus: no class D2 licence.
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1996 4 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `class B` `issued on` (YMD 2025 2 1)))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 20 `seats,` 7000 `kg gross,` 1600 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A class C licence of 10 January 2025 on a 10-tonne truck: until 10 January 2030, not after.
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1990 4 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `class C` `issued on` (YMD 2025 1 10)))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2030 1 10)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1990 4 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `class C` `issued on` (YMD 2025 1 10)))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2030 1 11)
-- 56(4), 59(1)(a): a 17-year-old on a moped needs no licence; a 15-year-old may not ride one.
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2009 1 1) `, of sex` `female` `, holding` EMPTY) `may drive` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 50 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2011 1 1) `, of sex` `female` `, holding` EMPTY) `may drive` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 50 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A 17-year-old with no licence on a 125 cm3 motorcycle: may not.
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2009 1 1) `, of sex` `female` `, holding` EMPTY) `may drive` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 125 `cm3, designed for` 100 `km/h, kerb mass` 120) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A former B2 licence with its printed term to 2027 drives a 7-seat car in 2026 (89(1)-(2)).
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1985 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `former class B2, for a professional driver` `issued on` (YMD 2017 5 1) `, expiring` (JUST (YMD 2027 5 1))))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 7 `seats,` 2400 `kg gross,` 550 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- Licences in a list: an expired former C beside a current A1 does not license a truck.
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1985 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `former class C` `issued on` (YMD 2014 5 1) `, expiring` (JUST (YMD 2025 5 1))), (`a licence of` `class A1` `issued on` (YMD 2025 3 1)))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats,` 10000 `kg gross,` 5000 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- A foreign licence alone: declined.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1985 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a foreign licence of` (`a class under Article 57` `class B`)))) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1) BECAUSE "a foreign or international licence is not mapped onto the classes of Article 57 in this model"
-- A bicycle needs neither licence nor age.
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 2016 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY) `may drive` (`a bicycle moved by` `human power, through pedals or a hand crank`) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- 56(2): a tractor operator of 20 with the machine certificate and the law certificate, and no licence.
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a driver born on` (YMD 2006 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY `, machine certificate` TRUE `, law certificate` TRUE `, army or police on duty` FALSE) `may drive` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a driver born on` (YMD 2006 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` EMPTY `, machine certificate` FALSE `, law certificate` TRUE `, army or police on duty` FALSE) `may drive` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- 89(2)(g): a former B2 licence still drives a tractor under 3,500 kg payload, with no certificate.
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a civilian born on` (YMD 1985 1 1) `, of sex` `male` `, holding` (LIST (`a licence of` `former class B2, for a professional driver` `issued on` (YMD 2017 5 1) `, expiring` (JUST (YMD 2027 5 1))))) `may drive` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- 56(5): a learner in a training automobile with an instructor drives with no licence; not on a motorcycle; and (fork F26) not under the class age (src 1006-1009).
#ASSERT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a learner born on` (YMD 2007 1 1)) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a learner born on` (YMD 2007 1 1)) `may drive` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 125 `cm3, designed for` 100 `km/h, kerb mass` 120) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Decision 1 — the driver` (`a learner born on` (YMD 2009 1 1)) `may drive` (`an automobile for` `carrying persons` `with` 5 `seats,` 2000 `kg gross,` 400 `kg payload, towing` NOTHING) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)
-- Article 56: which vehicles need a licence (src 969-972, 1003-1005, 982-986).
#ASSERT `Article 56 — a driving licence is required to drive` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 51 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 56 — a driving licence is required to drive` (`a petrol vehicle on` 2 `wheels, of` 50 `cm3, designed for` 50 `km/h, kerb mass` 90)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 56 — a driving licence is required to drive` (`a tractor with payload in kg` 2000)
#ASSERT `Article 56 — a driving licence is required to drive` (`a four-wheeler for` `carrying goods` `with` 2 `seats, designed for` 60 `km/h, kerb mass` 500 `, one chassis` TRUE `, rows of seats` 1 `, motor` (`an electric motor` 10))
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 56 — a driving licence is required to drive` (`a towed vehicle of` 3000 `kg gross, resting partly on the towing vehicle` FALSE `, special-use kind` NOTHING) BECAUSE "a trailer or semi-trailer is not driven by itself: describe the vehicle that tows it, with its trailer"
